y: java.lang.IllegalStateException: Unsupported iterable type found in [produkt.name]\r\n\t- matching type: java.util.concurrent.CompletionStage<java.util.List<de.blume2000.produkt.adapter.active.web.ProduktDTO>> \r\n\t- found in template [produktListPage.html] on line 11\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere is the code:\r\n\r\n```kotlin\r\n@Path(\"/reactiveProdukte\")\r\n@Produces(MediaType.TEXT_HTML)\r\nclass ReactiveProduktHtmlResource(private val reactiveProduktApplicationService: ReactiveProduktApplicationService) {\r\n\r\n  @GET\r\n  fun find(): Uni<String> {\r\n    val produkte = reactiveProduktApplicationService.execute(ZeigeAlleProdukteCommand)\r\n      .map(Produkt::toDTO)\r\n      .collectItems()\r\n      .asList()\r\n      .subscribeAsCompletionStage()\r\n    val produktListPage = ReactiveProduktHtmlTemplates.produktListPage(produkte).renderAsync()\r\n    return Uni.createFrom().completionStage(produktListPage)\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@CheckedTemplate\r\nobject ReactiveProduktHtmlTemplates {\r\n\r\n  @JvmStatic\r\n  external fun produktListPage(produkte: CompletionStage<List<ProduktDTO>>): TemplateInstance\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd the HTML:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<head>\r\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n  <title>Produktübersicht</title>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<h1>Produktübersicht</h1>\r\n{#for produkt in produkte}\r\n<li>\r\n  <b>{produkt.name}</b> {produkt.beschreibung}\r\n</li>\r\n{/for}\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere is a dependency Tree: \r\n[deps.txt](https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/files/5422089/deps.txt)\r\n\r\nWhat am I doing wrong?\r\nDoes this feature already exist?\r\n\r\nThere has been a zulip exchange regarding this issue: https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/#narrow/stream/187030-users/topic/qute-asynchronous-data-resolution-example","closed_by":{"login":"gastaldi","id":54133,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MTMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54133?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users